					until: start(regroup)
					modifier: {
						type: SkipPhase
						phase: skirmish
					}
				}
			]
		}
		gametext: Maneuver: If the fellowship is in region 2, place your unique companion with 4 or more vitality (except the Ring-bearer) in the dead pile to skip to the regroup phase.
